  "description": "Combine Pixaroma - Join Two Images is a multi-image composition workflow designed to combine or condition on multiple images in one controlled edit using the models configured in the graph. Its 10-node graph exposes 0 prompt/text field(s), 0 media input target(s), and 2 save/preview stage(s), while preserving the original editor-format graph for reference. The ComfyUI editor graph was converted to API format and is ready for live validation against the connected node and model registry.",
